{"ref":"BDB, עֵדָה⁴","hw":"עֵדָה⁴","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. testimony, witness</strong>, of things (only E);—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:30\" href=\"/Genesis.21.30\">Gn 21:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:52\" href=\"/Genesis.31.52\">31:52</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:27\" href=\"/Joshua.24.27\">Jos 24:27</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (J uses <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵד</span> for feminine things).—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדָה</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָעַד\" href=\"/BDB,_יָעַד\", dir=\"rtl\">יעד</a>.","next":"BDB, עוּד²","prev":"BDB, עֵד²"}